Hello Harry

I wish to let you know that I will not be releasing any sulphuric acid from=
 the labs. I have spoken with Mark Oxenbury and he has said it is not neede=
d for your Masters project.
Last week we also had a Fire Risk Assessment performed at both the Orchard =
Lab and the glasshouses. The feedback given was that chemicals were not bei=
ng stored appropriately down at the glasshouse ( there is no metal cabinet =
provision) so they should be removed and only used in very short-term situa=
tions. The appropriate technical teams have addressed this issue to ensure =
we are compliant.

Kind Regards

Angie

Angie Ward BSc. (Hons) Biology, FHEA, MIScT, R.Sci, CIMS

Technical Team Leader, Laboratories

School of Animal, Rural and Environmental Sciences (ARES)

Brackenhurst, Southwell, NG25 0QF

T: +44 (0)115 848 5254

M:  07930 252644

